ctronics** - receives a **purchase order of about Rs 6 crore including taxes and freight from Premia Solutionz for medical displays, equipment accessories and backlight units**, deliverable in 16 to 20 weeks _(~4.9% of mcap)_.","**Shayona Engineering** - **receives two purchase orders totalling Rs 2.01 crore** for engineering equipment _(~3.7% of mcap)_.","**EP Biocomposites** - **wins a Rs 0.92 crore order for a 70 KLD sewage treatment plant unit** _(~5.7% of mcap)_.","**Sonu Infratech** - **receives a Rs 0.54 crore work order** _(~1.0% of mcap)_.","**Silver Touch Technologies** - wins a **purchase order from ISRO's Space Applications Centre, Ahmedabad, to supply and support GPU-class high-end workstations**, delivery by 2 February 2027 under a tender reserved for local suppliers; value not disclosed."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Wheels India** - **allots 11,97,318 shares at Rs 2,088 in its qualified institutions placement, raising Rs 250 crore** at a 4.97% discount to the floor price, with Aditya Birla Sun Life, SBI and WhiteOak funds among the allottees _(~4.5% of mcap)_.","**Seshachal Technologies** - calls a **19 October EGM to approve a preferential issue of 55,000 shares at Rs 76, Rs 41.80 lakh, to two promoters**, Ch. Narendra and Ch. Anitha.","**Balaji Phosphates** - shareholders at the AGM **approve a preferential issue of up to 25 lakh convertible warrants at Rs 93.78, up to Rs 23.44 crore, plus 14,49,900 equity shares, all to the promoter and non-promoter group** for working capital and expansion _(~9.0% of mcap)_."],"equity_allotments":["**Sharika Enterprises** - **allots 1,21,92,125 shares at Rs 14.33, Rs 17.47 crore, to non-promoters and 28,12,315 warrants at the same price to promoter and non-promoter investors, collecting 25% upfront** - a new preferential issue _(~20.3% of mcap)_.","**Neogen Chemicals** - step-down subsidiary **Neogen Morita New Materials allots 7,20,000 shares at Rs 1,066.66, Rs 76.80 crore, to JV partner Morita Investment** under their 2025 joint-venture agreement - a subsidiary-level raise, not the parent's own capital.","**Baazar Style Retail** - allots **10,00,000 shares at Rs 328.25 on conversion of warrants, about Rs 3.28 crore**, to a non-promoter warrant holder; 76,00,000 warrants remain outstanding - a past conversion."],"m_and_a":["**IndiGrid Infrastructure Trust** - **signs agreements to buy Luhri Power Transmission from Enerica ReGrid once the project is complete and earning, at an enterprise value up to INR 13,360 million**, a related-party deal needing unitholder approval.","**Adani Enterprises** - wholly-owned Adani Global **buys 50% of Abu Dhabi-registered Monvarex Aluminium Holding for USD 25,000**, a nil-turnover vehicle to pursue alumina, aluminium smelting and coal-to-gas business in India.","**RPG Life Sciences** - subsidiary **RPG Active Pharma's board approves absorbing its wholly-owned Actis Generics**, which had FY26 revenue of Rs 45.96 crore; no shares will be issued, subject to NCLT and shareholder approval.","**H.G. Infra Engineering** - **acquires 100% of Ranipur Chunar Power Transmission from REC Power Development for Rs 5 lakh**, the SPV to build 220/132/33 kV substations at Mau and Mirzapur in Uttar Pradesh under a 35-year transmission project.","**Dr. Lal PathLabs** - Dubai subsidiary **completes acquiring an 80% stake in Sunshine Healthcare, Ghana**, which becomes a step-down subsidiary; a deal first approved in July.","**KPI Green Energy** - material subsidiary **Sun Drops Energia completes acquiring 62.91% of DEK and Mavericks Green Energy**, which becomes a step-down subsidiary; consideration not disclosed.","**Transcorp International** - says its **2022 scheme of arrangement is not being progressed in its existing form** after its principal regulator conveyed its position; the board will reconsider it.","⚑ **Raghav Productivity Enhancers Limited** — Incorporation of Joint Venture Entity _(⚑ filing content disagrees with the subject tag — held out of 