s evaluating a response.","**Speciality Restaurants** - the **Enforcement Directorate provisionally attaches Rs 14.50 crore under PMLA**, the upfront warrant money it had forfeited from defaulting allottees; the company is not named as an accused.","**Saurashtra Cement** - receives a **Maharashtra state-tax show cause notice under the CGST/MGST Act**; amount not stated in the notice.","**Panacea Biotec** - receives **four income-tax demand orders aggregating about Rs 9.82 crore** for alleged under-reporting of income.","**Electrotherm (India)** - the **Enforcement Directorate issues a provisional attachment order under PMLA against the company and two promoters' movable properties**, part of a probe running since 2025; amount not stated.","**Som Distilleries and Breweries** - the **Madhya Pradesh High Court quashes an order rejecting its excise-licence renewals and orders renewal within 15 days**, also awarding it Rs 1 lakh in costs and preserving its right to claim further damages.","**Voith Paper Fabrics India** - receives an **income-tax assessment order and demand notice for Rs 3.82 crore** for AY 2023-24.","**Delta Corp** - subsidiaries Highstreet Cruises and Delta Pleasure Cruise **receive fresh CGST and Goa GST orders on a tax shortfall dating to 2017-2022**; amount not stated in the disclosure supplied.","**Tata Communications** - the **Income Tax Appellate Tribunal grants it relief on an AY2011-12 dispute**, including its Section 80-IA deduction claim; some matters still need the Assessing Officer's recomputation.","**Cemantic Infra-Tech** - the **NCLT Hyderabad Bench declines interim relief and adjourns a Section 241-242 oppression petition against the company to 25 November**.","⚑ **Samyak International Ltd** — Intimation under Regulation 30 of the SEBI Listing Regulations, as amended - Successful Resolution Applicant. _(⚑ filing content disagrees with the subject tag — held out of movers)_","**Kalahridhaan Trendz Limited** — Kalahridhaan Trendz Limited h